  m_text: "A / D  OR  ARROWS\nMOVE\n\nHOLD SPACE\nFIRE\n\nESC  PAUSE     M  MUTE\n\nGAMEPAD: STICK, SOUTH, START\n\n\nDODGE THE EGGS - ONE HIT\nCOSTS A LIFE. WOBBLING\nCHICKENS ARE ABOUT TO DIVE.\nCLEAR FOUR WAVES, THEN\nBEAT THE MOTHER HEN."
